OL,3,GNEWSAFamily appeal over canal bike
OL,4,Amystery
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was later found with injuries on the
OL,7,Fgrounds of Smestow Academy in Windmill
OL,8,FCrescent. A coroner subsequently
OL,9,Fconcluded he died from head and facial
OL,10,Finjuries of an unknown cause, police
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FThe appeal was launched on Thursday,
OL,14,Fwhich would have been his 46th
OL,15,Fbirthday, to trace whoever pulled his
OL,16,Fe-bike from the canal and left it near
OL,17,Fa bridge.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
